2026-07-28T06:37:12.6226522Z [36;1m# / -std=gnu++20 for C++); a plain "CC = ccache gcc" override would drop[0m
2026-07-28T06:37:12.6226897Z [36;1m# them and silently downgrade the standard across the version matrix.[0m
2026-07-28T06:37:12.6227282Z [36;1m# Inference uses an empty user Makevars so we always read the pristine[0m
2026-07-28T06:37:12.6227622Z [36;1m# Makeconf defaults, never a value we just wrote.[0m
